{
    "title": "MamoBall 4v4 Online Soccer",
    "description": "Looking for a game to play online football on mobile? Here\u2019s MamoBall for you.\r\n\r\nMamoBall is a unique 2D football game, a mix of football and hockey, that you can play online in real time with your friends or players from all around the world. Whether you want to climb the ranks and collect cups in 4v4 ranked matches, or set up a lobby to play with your friends from 1v1 to 4v4, the choice is yours.\r\n\r\nThe game mechanics might seem simple, but we should warn you upfront: you won\u2019t be able to beat your opponents without strategy and a good football IQ. It may take you some time to get used to the controls, but once you master them, you won\u2019t be able to stop playing.\r\n\r\nRemember, there are no bots in this game, every player is real.\r\n\r\nRight now, tournaments are being held in many countries with thousands of participants joining through Discord channels. Don\u2019t miss out\u2014come, create your team, and take part in the tournaments.\r\n\r\nWe don\u2019t need to say more\u2014hop on the train if you want to see for yourself.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for a game to play online football on mobile? Here\u2019s MamoBall for you.<br><br>MamoBall is a unique 2D football game, a mix of football and hockey, that you can play online in real time with your friends or players from all around the world. Whether you want to climb the ranks and collect cups in 4v4 ranked matches, or set up a lobby to play with your friends from 1v1 to 4v4, the choice is yours.<br><br>The game mechanics might seem simple, but we should warn you upfront: you won\u2019t be able to beat your opponents without strategy and a good football IQ. It may take you some time to get used to the controls, but once you master them, you won\u2019t be able to stop playing.<br><br>Remember, there are no bots in this game, every player is real.<br><br>Right now, tournaments are being held in many countries with thousands of participants joining through Discord channels. Don\u2019t miss out\u2014come, create your team, and take part in the tournaments.<br><br>We don\u2019t need to say more\u2014hop on the train if you want to see for yourself.",
